{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Stickman is an action-packed fighting game where players take on the role of a powerful stickman warrior, battling through intense levels filled with enemies, challenges, and epic boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Legend - Endless Heroes, Infinite Possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your stickman warrior with unique weapons, armor, and abilities. Unlock rare heroes, each with distinct fighting styles and special moves, to create your ultimate combat team. Every choice shapes your legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Your Destiny - Assemble the Ultimate Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade legendary stickman fighters, from nimble assassins to mighty tanks. Strategically combine their skills to dominate the arena. Will you focus on brute strength or tactical synergy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Chaos - Explosive Battles Await</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience heart-pounding combat with destructible environments and screen-shaking special attacks. Dodge, counter, and unleash devastating ultimate moves in fast-paced 1v1 duels and massive team brawls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unite &amp; Rise - Build Your Legendary Guild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with players worldwide to form unstoppable guilds. Compete in weekly guild wars, share rare resources, and unlock exclusive guild-exclusive heroes and skins through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Adventures - Discover Hidden Surprises</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons with randomized challenges and rewards. From ancient temples to futuristic battlefields, each playthrough offers new secrets to uncover and bosses to conquer!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611640?t=1748503718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611640/fd80f3f560567e297d05b00a6a9ca5b30d035cb9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748503718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611640/8bcbf66984c5b4fe97ecd06bc9fc294b2e45980c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748503718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611640/8bcbf66984c5b4fe97ecd06bc9fc294b2e45980c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748503718","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero Stickman is an action-packed fighting game where players take on the role of a powerful stickman warrior, battling through intense levels filled with enemies, challenges, and epic boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Legend - Endless Heroes, Infinite Possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your stickman warrior with unique weapons, armor, and abilities. Unlock rare heroes, each with distinct fighting styles and special moves, to create your ultimate combat team. Every choice shapes your legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Your Destiny - Assemble the Ultimate Team</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and upgrade legendary stickman fighters, from nimble assassins to mighty tanks. Strategically combine their skills to dominate the arena. Will you focus on brute strength or tactical synergy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Chaos - Explosive Battles Await</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience heart-pounding combat with destructible environments and screen-shaking special attacks. Dodge, counter, and unleash devastating ultimate moves in fast-paced 1v1 duels and massive team brawls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unite &amp; Rise - Build Your Legendary Guild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with players worldwide to form unstoppable guilds. Compete in weekly guild wars, share rare resources, and unlock exclusive guild-exclusive heroes and skins through teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Adventures - Discover Hidden Surprises</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons with randomized challenges and rewards. From ancient temples to futuristic battlefields, each playthrough offers new secrets to uncover and bosses to conquer!</p>","developers":["R2 Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"R2 Games ID ","genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611640/1ac3e73ba36d4532095f2006c311547bf3189d32/header.jpg?t=1748503718","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3611640/879560/805a9611d94f59a529a466c0ee66418632f2a5f0/1750451740/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746667020","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3611640/879560/805a9611d94f59a529a466c0ee66418632f2a5f0/1750451740/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746667020","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3611640/879560/805a9611d94f59a529a466c0ee66418632f2a5f0/1750451740/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746667020","id":257131901,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131901/movie480.mp4?t=1746667020","max":"https://video.akamai.steamst